  "summary": "C13 reloads /tmp/sst.npz (written by C8 from daily files 1991-12-27..2003-08-31 over the 60x60 region). It computes per-cell hazen 90th-percentile pools over \u00b15-day windows for 1992-2002 and smooths them with a 31-day wrap-around mean. Only smoothed days of year 153-244 are used, which draw on raw days of year 138-259 and therefore on May 12-Sep 20 of each baseline year. These thresholds are compared with the 2003-06-01..08-31 SST of every sea cell, and the resulting runs are joined and written to output/mhw_mask.nc."
